{"id":"msg_m_mainafter_07_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_counters","label":"Counters · Group"},"label":"7. Hey,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_mainafter_04_01","next":"msg_m_mainafter_09_02","speakers":{"neon":"Neon","anis":"Anis","rapi":"Rapi"},"icons":{"neon":"si_c011_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_1","text":"Hey,","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_2","text":"did you know that Heretic?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_3","text":"Yup, sure do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_4","text":"Master?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_5","text":"I do too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_6","text":"Whoa,","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_7","text":"I heard that she's a Rapture spy. So cool!","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_8","text":"Kinda makes me feel inferior, just spying for a puny little megacorporation!","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_9","text":"I'm sure you'll get there one day.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_10","text":"Ha, thanks!","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_11","text":"But I'm not actually being serious.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_12","text":"Anyway, did you actually work with her before?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_13","text":"Yes, we once fought together on the same side.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_14","text":"Did something happen during that battle?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_15","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_16","text":"I never thought I would see her again, and certainly not like this...","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_17","text":"I saw her head...","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_18","text":"Anyway...","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_19","text":"Now's not the right time to talk about this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_20","text":"The chances of a Nikke becoming a Heretic are incredibly minute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_21","text":"Marian seems to be one of those few cases.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_22","text":"But somehow, it seemed like she recognized Master.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_23","text":"So does she still have a chance?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_24","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_25","text":"A chance to start over.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_26","text":"Stop dreaming.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_27","text":"Once you become a Heretic, there's no going back.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_28","text":"After you turn, your memories are gone for good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_29","text":"How horrible...","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_30","text":"In any case...","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_31","text":"There has to be a way to bring her back.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_32","text":"But how?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_33","text":"I'll do some digging.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_34","text":"Let me help you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_35","text":"Any friend of yours is a friend of mine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_36","text":"That's very kind of you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_37","text":"If you ever come up with a plan, let me know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_38","text":"I'll be ready.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_07_01_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_07_01_39","text":"I will.","jump":null}],"chat":true}